{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2022-12-16 09:52:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CUSTOMER SERVICE EMPLOYEES APPROVE NEW FIVE-YEAR CONTRACT', 'text': 'DALLAS , DEC. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE INTERNATIONAL ASSOCIATION OF MACHINISTS AND AEROSPACE WORKERS (IAM), REPRESENTING THE MORE THAN 8,000 CUSTOMER SERVICE EMPLOYEES AT SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV), ANNOUNCED TODAY THEIR MEMBERS VOTED IN FAVOR OF A NEW, FIVE-YEAR CONTRACT. "OUR EMPLOYEES WORK HARD TO TAKE CARE OF OUR CUSTOMERS EVERY DAY, AND THAT\'S EVEN MORE EVIDENT DURING THIS BUSY HOLIDAY TRAVEL SEASON," SAID ADAM CARLISLE , VICE PRESIDENT LABOR RELATIONS AT SOUTHWEST AIRLINES®.'}